\midrule
Restart           & --        & --        & --        & --        & --        \\
AlwaysHybrid      & --        & --        & \ding{51} & \ding{51} & \ding{51} \\
FixedGap          & \ding{51} & --        & \ding{51} & \ding{51} & \ding{51} \\
w/o\,OptLater     & \ding{51} & \ding{51} & \ding{51} & --        & \ding{51} \\
